[19.9582, "o", "| `total_spend_cents` | integer | settled sales minus settled refunds that day (may be negative) |\r\n| `currency` | string ISO-4217 | currency of the amounts |\r\n| *customer profile attributes* | — | the customer's profile attributes from custops (`segment` and `country` are the ones the dashboard slices on today; the explorer exposes every stored record attribute as an ad-hoc filter, so Growth asked for the profile attributes we hold) |\r\n\r\nOne record per (`customer_id`, `activity_date`) that had at least one settled transaction (sale or\r\nrefund). Days with no settled transactions are omitted. `pending` and `declined` transactions never\r\ncontribute.\r\n\r\n## Service behaviour\r\n\r\n* Requests are validated for the envelope shape (`records` list, each with `customer_id` and\r\n  `activity_date`); accepted batches are stored and loaded into the dashboard's data store.\r\n* Idempotency is by (`source`, `period`, batch content); re-sending the same month replaces the\r\n  prior load, so a full re-run of a period is safe.\r\n* `GET /healthz` returns `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`; `GET /v1/ingest/stats` reports how many requests were persisted.\r\n"]
[19.959493, "o", "# Growth dashboard (consumer of the activity feed)\r\n\r\nThe Growth dashboard is the Metabase workspace the Growth analytics team maintains for the\r\ncommercial organisation. The Customer Activity pages are built from the custops activity feed\r\n(`docs/analytics_ingest_contract.md`).\r\n\r\n* **Pages:** activity heatmap (customer-days by date), segment and country breakdowns, retention\r\n  cohorts keyed on `customer_id`. Charts aggregate; nothing on the pages is keyed on an individual\r\n  person.\r\n* **Viewers:** everyone in the commercial organisation — sales, marketing, partnerships, customer\r\n  success (~90 people) — plus the Growth analysts. Viewers can use the explorer to filter on any\r\n  attribute present in the stored records and can export query results to CSV.\r\n* **Storage:** records are kept in the Growth data lake exactly as received, for 24 months.\r\n* **Ownership:** growth-analytics@northgate.example; dashboard changes go through the Growth team,\r\n  feed changes through custops.\r\n"]
